---
title: Uploading check-in photos and documents
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Staff
  participant Browser
  participant Storage as Supabase Storage<br/>(private bucket)
  participant App as Next.js app
  participant DB as Postgres

  Staff->>Browser: Pick photos or PDFs (camera on phones)
  Browser->>Browser: Check type (JPEG, PNG, WebP, HEIC, PDF) and size (≤ 10 MB)
  Browser->>Storage: Upload to job-attachments/<workshop>/<job>/<random>.<ext> with the user's session
  Storage->>DB: Policy can_upload_job_attachment(path)
  Note over DB: Path's workshop and job must exist together,<br/>and the user needs jobs.manage there
  Storage-->>Browser: Stored (or 403)
  Browser->>App: recordAttachment(path, name, type, size, category)
  App->>App: requirePermission("jobs.manage") · path must start with this workshop/job
  App->>DB: Insert job_attachments row
  Note over DB: RLS + check: path matches the row's workshop and job,<br/>and the file really exists in storage
  App-->>Browser: Refresh job page
  Browser->>App: Load job page
  App->>Storage: createSignedUrls(paths, 1 hour)
  Storage-->>App: Expiring links
  App-->>Staff: Thumbnails and downloads (links expire, files never public)
